WEBVTT

00:01.827 --> 00:05.937
One day, as the prince was bored in his castle, he thought of something.

00:06.097 --> 00:09.827
There must be a lot of fun things to do outside!

00:10.527 --> 00:14.417
So on the spur of the moment, the prince walked outside.

00:15.067 --> 00:15.717
And then...

00:16.247 --> 00:17.627
Hey, your Highness.

00:17.627 --> 00:18.917
Are you on a picnic?

00:19.007 --> 00:20.487
Then take this with you.

00:20.667 --> 00:22.357
I'm sure it'll be useful.

00:22.627 --> 00:23.527
See ya.

00:23.687 --> 00:25.717
Thank you, Sharky Tamami-gon.

00:26.437 --> 00:30.267
After getting the sketchbook, the prince started to walk with a smile.

00:30.267 --> 00:30.887
Then...

00:31.187 --> 00:32.847
My, my, your highness.

00:32.847 --> 00:34.137
Are you on a picnic?

00:34.557 --> 00:37.417
Then take these with you.

00:37.557 --> 00:39.577
I'm sure they'll be useful.

00:39.747 --> 00:41.407
Thank you, Duke Frog.

00:41.547 --> 00:42.907
No problem.

00:42.907 --> 00:45.487
Now, your highness, have a nice picnic.

00:46.527 --> 00:48.597
This is how the Prince did not...

00:48.807 --> 00:52.547
...go on a quest to slay a villain or a dragon as would be expected,

00:52.907 --> 00:54.987
but instead just went on an ordinary picnic.

00:56.797 --> 01:02.467
