10:55.007 --> 10:59.617
You came to Tokyo to study to become a children's book author?

11:00.627 --> 11:01.627
Y-Yes.

11:02.177 --> 11:03.927
That's great, Shiratori-kun.

11:03.927 --> 11:05.197
That's really great.

11:05.197 --> 11:06.857
