18:21.657 --> 18:24.057
I'm glad I moved to Tokyo.

18:24.767 --> 18:27.417
It's kind of a strange apartment, though.

18:56.707 --> 18:58.367
Kozue Onee-chan...

18:58.367 --> 18:59.637
That looks really yummy.

19:00.007 --> 19:01.417
Oh dear, Kozue-chan.

19:01.507 --> 19:03.327
She looks so happy.

19:03.327 --> 19:04.507
That looks suspicious.

19:08.747 --> 19:11.377
We have a really nice Landlady.

19:12.047 --> 19:16.707
